不等式 \(\frac{x-4}{x-1}\ge 2\) 的解集是（\quad）

\choices
    {\(\{x \mid -2\le x\le 1\}\)}
    {\(\{x \mid x\le -2\}\)}
    {\(\{x \mid -2\le x<1\}\)}
    {\(\{x \mid x>1\}\)}

answer.explanation:
由余弦定理，
\[
\cos A=\frac{AB^2+AC^2-BC^2}{2AB\cdot AC}
=\frac{6+\left(1+\sqrt3\right)^2-4}{2\sqrt6\left(1+\sqrt3\right)}
=\frac{\sqrt2}{2}
\]
又 \(0^\circ<A<180^\circ\)，故 \(A=45^\circ\). 故选：A.

